<c.simplifiedchinese>好 来吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

114
00:06:58.793 --> 00:07:00.878 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>看看你是不是照我的吩咐</c.simplifiedchinese>

115
00:07:00.962 --> 00:07:04.715 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>做了店主房间和钱箱的钥匙模子</c.simplifiedchinese>

116
00:07:06.008 --> 00:07:08.928 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不…不能这样 干雄大人</c.simplifiedchinese>

117
00:07:09.011 --> 00:07:12.932 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>盗窃有损长冈家的名誉！</c.simplifiedchinese>

118
00:07:13.641 --> 00:07:14.892 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你…</c.simplifiedchinese>

119
00:07:14.976 --> 00:07:18.729 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么时候轮到你对我指手画脚了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

120
00:07:18.813 --> 00:07:20.940 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>江户三百多年</c.simplifiedchinese>

121
00:07:21.023 --> 00:07:25.945 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你那贫穷的武士家族
一直为我的家族服务！</c.simplifiedchinese>

122
00:07:26.028 --> 00:07:29.115 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但新政府上台后</c.simplifiedchinese>

123
00:07:29.198 --> 00:07:32.660 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们突然就变成毫无关系的陌生人了</c.simplifiedchinese>

124
00:07:32.743 --> 00:07:35.455 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>明治真是一个讨厌的时代</c.simplifiedchinese>

125
00:07:35.538 --> 00:07:37.748 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>已经没有忠义可言</c.simplifiedchinese>

126
00:07:37.832 --> 00:07:40.001 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他们鼓吹四民平等</c.simplifiedchinese>

127
00:07:40.084 --> 00:07:43.963 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>践踏了三百多年的恩义</c.simplifiedchinese>

128
00:07:44.046 --> 00:07:44.881 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

129
00:07:44.964 --> 00:07:46.966 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这可是强盗行为…</c.simplifiedchinese>

130
00:07:47.758 --> 00:07:49.844 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我知道</c.simplifiedchinese>

131
00:07:49.927 --> 00:07:52.763 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我不会再对一个陌生人发号施令了</c.simplifiedchinese>

132
00:07:53.264 --> 00:07:55.933 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我会按我的方法做</c.simplifiedchinese>

133
00:07:56.017 --> 00:08:00.563 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>没有钥匙 只能把店里的人都杀了</c.simplifiedchinese>

134
00:08:00.646 --> 00:08:04.650 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不然留下目击者 会损害长冈家名誉</c.simplifiedchinese>

135
00:08:05.485 --> 00:08:09.864 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>只能连那个叫妙的一起杀了</c.simplifiedchinese>

136
00:08:14.744 --> 00:08:16.287 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这就对了</c.simplifiedchinese>

137
00:08:16.370 --> 00:08:17.413 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>蠢货！</c.simplifiedchinese>

138
00:08:18.122 --> 00:08:20.541 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>进入明治时代已经十年了</c.simplifiedchinese>

139
00:08:20.625 --> 00:08:23.211 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你还执着于什么“主从”关系啊！</c.simplifiedchinese>

140
00:08:23.294 --> 00:08:24.128 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>谁啊！</c.simplifiedchinese>

141
00:08:24.212 --> 00:08:26.297 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>跟你说话呢 鬓角混蛋！</c.simplifiedchinese>

142
00:08:26.380 --> 00:08:30.176 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>同为武士后裔 我绝不能放过你</c.simplifiedchinese>

143
00:08:30.259 --> 00:08:31.260 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>弥彦弟弟</c.simplifiedchinese>

144
00:08:31.344 --> 00:08:33.804 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>都说了不要叫“弟弟”！</c.simplifiedchinese>

145
00:08:37.808 --> 00:08:38.726 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>喂！</c.simplifiedchinese>

146
00:08:38.809 --> 00:08:40.937 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>快放弃那些愚蠢的强盗想法吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

147
00:08:41.020 --> 00:08:45.816 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>否则我东京武士族明神弥彦
会出手收拾你！</c.simplifiedchinese>

148
00:08:45.900 --> 00:08:47.109 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>住嘴！</c.simplifiedchinese>

149
00:08:47.193 --> 00:08:49.195 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-小鬼！
-身体！</c.simplifiedchinese>

150
00:08:49.278 --> 00:08:50.404 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你…</c.simplifiedchinese>

151
00:08:52.073 --> 00:08:52.907 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我可以</c.simplifiedchinese>

152
00:08:52.990 --> 00:08:54.992 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我的剑术训练有效果</c.simplifiedchinese>

153
00:08:55.076 --> 00:08:56.494 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-臭小子！
-来啊！</c.simplifiedchinese>

154
00:08:59.205 --> 00:09:00.414 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那个给我</c.simplifiedchinese>

155
00:09:04.335 --> 00:09:05.253 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>就是现在！</c.simplifiedchinese>

156
00:09:05.336 --> 00:09:06.921 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>围住他 给我打！</c.simplifiedchinese>

157
00:09:09.799 --> 00:09:10.633 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>哦啰！</c.simplifiedchinese>

158
00:09:10.716 --> 00:09:13.886 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你怎么还能悠闲地看戏？</c.simplifiedchinese>

159
00:09:14.595 --> 00:09:17.223 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他说得对 弥彦有危险</c.simplifiedchinese>

160
00:09:17.306 --> 00:09:19.225 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>冷静点</c.simplifiedchinese>

161
00:09:19.308 --> 00:09:21.185 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我怎么冷静得了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

162
00:09:21.269 --> 00:09:23.688 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那孩子可是我的宝贝首席弟子</c.simplifiedchinese>

163
00:09:23.771 --> 00:09:25.147 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>先等一下</c.simplifiedchinese>

164
00:09:25.231 --> 00:09:28.609 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>弥彦还没有发现我们在这</c.simplifiedchinese>

165
00:09:28.693 --> 00:09:31.862 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们突然出现会很不自然</c.simplifiedchinese>

166
00:09:31.946 --> 00:09:32.822 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

167
00:09:32.905 --> 00:09:34.699 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果总是等别人来拯救</c.simplifiedchinese>

168
00:09:34.782 --> 00:09:37.702 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他永远也不会变强</c.simplifiedchinese>

169
00:09:38.286 --> 00:09:39.996 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是弥彦的战斗</c.simplifiedchinese>

170
00:09:40.663 --> 00:09:43.124 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>只要他不寻求我们的帮助</c.simplifiedchinese>

171
00:09:43.207 --> 00:09:46.377 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们没有必要出手</c.simplifiedchinese>

172
00:09:47.211 --> 00:09:51.841 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>效仿“狮子把幼崽推到谷底”
来锻炼他啊…</c.simplifiedchinese>

173
00:09:52.341 --> 00:09:53.342 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过…</c.simplifiedchinese>

174
00:09:54.010 --> 00:09:55.052 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>停手！</c.simplifiedchinese>

175
00:09:55.136 --> 00:09:57.680 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>求你了 让他们停手 干雄大人！</c.simplifiedchinese>

176
00:09:57.763 --> 00:09:59.515 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这件事与他无关</c.simplifiedchinese>

177
00:09:59.599 --> 00:10:01.559 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我把钥匙模子给你就是</c.simplifiedchinese>

178
00:10:03.227 --> 00:10:04.687 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>喂！</c.simplifiedchinese>

179
00:10:04.770 --> 00:10:07.148 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们还有更重要的事做</c.simplifiedchinese>

180
00:10:07.231 --> 00:10:08.566 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>放开他吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

181
00:10:08.649 --> 00:10:09.859 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是</c.simplifiedchinese>

182
00:10:12.903 --> 00:10:14.071 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你还好吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

183
00:10:14.155 --> 00:10:15.281 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>该死！</c.simplifiedchinese>

184
00:10:15.364 --> 00:10:17.825 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果是一对一 我早把他们打败了…</c.simplifiedchinese>

185
00:10:17.908 --> 00:10:19.285 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>燕</c.simplifiedchinese>

186
00:10:19.368 --> 00:10:22.163 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>今后也要为主人效力哦</c.simplifiedchinese>

187
00:10:23.372 --> 00:10:24.749 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>回见</c.simplifiedchinese>

188
00:10:24.832 --> 00:10:26.375 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>弥彦弟弟</c.simplifiedchinese>

189
00:10:28.878 --> 00:10:30.338 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>对不起</c.simplifiedchinese>

190
00:10:30.421 --> 00:10:32.882 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>把你卷进这种事…</c.simplifiedchinese>

191
00:10:33.507 --> 00:10:34.800 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>真的对不起</c.simplifiedchinese>

192
00:10:38.512 --> 00:10:44.060 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>用模具做出钥匙 最少也要一天时间</c.simplifiedchinese>

193
00:10:44.143 --> 00:10:46.771 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>也就是说 他们明晚之后才能行动</c.simplifiedchinese>

194
00:10:46.854 --> 00:10:48.314 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>弥彦弟弟？</c.simplifiedchinese>

195
00:10:48.397 --> 00:10:49.482 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>没关系啦</c.simplifiedchinese>

196
00:10:50.191 --> 00:10:53.944 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>连这种小混混都打不过
我的确还是“弥彦弟弟”</c.simplifiedchinese>

197
00:10:54.695 --> 00:10:59.533 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>而且不是你把我卷进来
是我主动插手帮你</c.simplifiedchinese>

198
00:11:00.284 --> 00:11:02.495 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>所以你别内疚了</c.simplifiedchinese>

199
00:11:08.334 --> 00:11:09.585 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>弥彦弟弟…</c.simplifiedchinese>

200
00:11:11.754 --> 00:11:13.714 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不能告诉警察</c.simplifiedchinese>

201
00:11:13.798 --> 00:11:16.675 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不然她会被当成共犯的</c.simplifiedchinese>

202
00:11:16.759 --> 00:11:19.303 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>也不能请剑心他们帮忙</c.simplifiedchinese>

203
00:11:19.887 --> 00:11:24.558 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>对付那些流氓 不能麻烦剑心他们</c.simplifiedchinese>

204
00:11:26.060 --> 00:11:29.021 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是我的战斗</c.simplifiedchinese>

205
00:11:32.983 --> 00:11:35.611 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:10.00% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>（第二天早上）</c.simplifiedchinese>

206
00:11:36.821 --> 00:11:39.323 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>嗯 差不多做完了</c.simplifiedchinese>

207
00:11:39.407 --> 00:11:41.700 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那是什么玩具啊？</c.simplifiedchinese>

208
00:11:41.784 --> 00:11:42.660 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>蠢货！</c.simplifiedchinese>

209
00:11:42.743 --> 00:11:46.414 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是为了练习同时对抗多个敌人
而设计的训练器</c.simplifiedchinese>

210
00:11:46.497 --> 00:11:47.873 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>没用的</c.simplifiedchinese>

211
00:11:48.457 --> 00:11:49.750 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那种东西没用的</c.simplifiedchinese>

212
00:11:49.834 --> 00:11:51.210 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你说什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

213
00:11:51.293 --> 00:11:52.461 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>当然了</c.simplifiedchinese>

214
00:11:52.545 --> 00:11:56.298 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>木板的移动方式是固定的</c.simplifiedchinese>

215
00:11:56.382 --> 00:11:58.592 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>真正的对手可没有固定的套路</c.simplifiedchinese>

216
00:11:58.676 --> 00:12:03.597 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>联合式、波浪式、包围式
以各种复杂形式进行攻击</c.simplifiedchinese>

217
00:12:04.515 --> 00:12:09.061 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>就算它能锻炼你的反射神经
也不是一朝一夕就能做到的</c.simplifiedchinese>

218
00:12:10.646 --> 00:12:12.565 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>真是小孩子的天真想法</c.simplifiedchinese>

219
00:12:13.315 --> 00:12:14.650 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>烦死了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

220
00:12:17.403 --> 00:12:18.779 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>喂 剑心</c.simplifiedchinese>

221
00:12:18.863 --> 00:12:19.738 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>哦啰？</c.simplifiedchinese>

222
00:12:19.822 --> 00:12:21.615 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我能问你一件事吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

223
00:12:21.699 --> 00:12:24.118 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我想知道同时一对多的方法</c.simplifiedchinese>

224
00:12:24.201 --> 00:12:26.120 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>怎么突然想起问这个？</c.simplifiedchinese>

225
00:12:27.455 --> 00:12:29.957 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>反正我就是想知道</c.simplifiedchinese>

226
00:12:32.543 --> 00:12:33.752 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

227
00:12:34.253 --> 00:12:37.381 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>其实在下知道一个办法</c.simplifiedchinese>

228
00:12:37.465 --> 00:12:38.632 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>真的吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

229
00:12:38.716 --> 00:12:40.176 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那是幕末时期</c.simplifiedchinese>

230
00:12:40.259 --> 00:12:43.929 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>维新志士在人数劣势时使用的方法</c.simplifiedchinese>

231
00:12:44.472 --> 00:12:46.932 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你先逃走</c.simplifiedchinese>

232
00:12:47.016 --> 00:12:48.642 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-逃走？
-对</c.simplifiedchinese>

233
00:12:49.727 --> 00:12:53.230 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>准确来说是假装逃走</c.simplifiedchinese>

234
00:12:53.981 --> 00:12:55.774 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>敌人当然会来追你</c.simplifiedchinese>

235
00:12:55.858 --> 00:12:58.569 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>因为个体差异 每个人速度不同</c.simplifiedchinese>

236
00:12:58.652 --> 00:13:02.323 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>会自然而然地按快慢形成队列</c.simplifiedchinese>

237
00:13:02.406 --> 00:13:07.161 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你利用这点
转身消灭第一个追兵 然后再逃跑</c.simplifiedchinese>

238
00:13:07.745 --> 00:13:08.913 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>重复几次</c.simplifiedchinese>

239
00:13:08.996 --> 00:13:14.335 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>就能全灭敌人 甚至可以毫发无伤</c.simplifiedchinese>

240
00:13:14.418 --> 00:13:15.586 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我懂了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

241
00:13:15.669 --> 00:13:20.466 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但要做到这一点
久经锻炼的出色脚力必不可少</c.simplifiedchinese>

242
00:13:21.217 --> 00:13:22.384 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>原来如此…</c.simplifiedchinese>

243
00:13:22.468 --> 00:13:26.430 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>重点是寻找和敌人一对一战斗的机会</c.simplifiedchinese>

244
00:13:27.139 --> 00:13:29.433 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这一点你仔细想想吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

245
00:13:30.017 --> 00:13:33.145 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>和敌人一对一战斗的机会…</c.simplifiedchinese>

246
00:13:34.063 --> 00:13:34.980 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>弥彦</c.simplifiedchinese>

247
00:13:35.689 --> 00:13:38.359 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>神谷活心流是救人剑</c.simplifiedchinese>

248
00:13:38.442 --> 00:13:41.946 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是为了他人而挥舞 保护别人的剑</c.simplifiedchinese>

249
00:13:42.905 --> 00:13:44.073 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>一把剑</c.simplifiedchinese>

250
00:13:44.156 --> 00:13:47.743 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>同时关系着你自己和要保护的人
两个人的命运</c.simplifiedchinese>

251
00:13:48.244 --> 00:13:52.623 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果输了 不仅是自己
要保护的人也会受到伤害</c.simplifiedchinese>

252
00:13:53.249 --> 00:13:57.044 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>挥舞救人剑的剑客绝不能失败</c.simplifiedchinese>

253
00:13:57.711 --> 00:13:59.880 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这一点你一定要记住</c.simplifiedchinese>

254
00:14:08.597 --> 00:14:11.934 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:10.00% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>（红牛酒馆 店主家）</c.simplifiedchinese>

255
00:14:12.893 --> 00:14:14.270 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>好 我们走</c.simplifiedchinese>

256
00:14:14.353 --> 00:14:17.231 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们真的要这么做吗 干雄大人？</c.simplifiedchinese>

257
00:14:17.314 --> 00:14:18.357 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

258
00:14:18.440 --> 00:14:20.693 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>事到如今你还怕什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

259
00:14:20.776 --> 00:14:21.652 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我跟你说过吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

260
00:14:21.735 --> 00:14:26.073 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>商人的钱本来是属于我们武士族的</c.simplifiedchinese>

261
00:14:26.156 --> 00:14:29.785 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>直接拿走有什么关系？</c.simplifiedchinese>

262
00:14:29.869 --> 00:14:32.037 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>更何况我们不可能失败</c.simplifiedchinese>

263
00:14:32.121 --> 00:14:35.624 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>为了这个还特意配了钥匙…</c.simplifiedchinese>

264
00:14:39.003 --> 00:14:40.504 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你是昨天那个…</c.simplifiedchinese>

265
00:14:40.588 --> 00:14:42.506 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你这小子 还给我！</c.simplifiedchinese>

266
00:14:42.590 --> 00:14:44.800 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你想要就用武力来拿！</c.simplifiedchinese>

267
00:14:44.884 --> 00:14:46.635 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你应该很擅长才对</c.simplifiedchinese>

268
00:14:46.719 --> 00:14:48.220 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>给我站住！</c.simplifiedchinese>

269
00:14:49.555 --> 00:14:51.140 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>弥彦弟弟</c.simplifiedchinese>

270
00:14:52.266 --> 00:14:54.143 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>等一下！站住 别跑！</c.simplifiedchinese>

271
00:14:54.226 --> 00:14:55.644 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>追到他了</c.simplifiedchinese>

272
00:14:55.728 --> 00:14:57.146 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>做好准备吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

273
00:14:58.439 --> 00:15:02.067 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>守护之人的命运就悬在我的剑上</c.simplifiedchinese>

274
00:15:02.860 --> 00:15:04.778 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>绝不允许失败</c.simplifiedchinese>

275
00:15:05.487 --> 00:15:07.865 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>神谷活心流 明神弥彦！</c.simplifiedchinese>

276
00:15:07.948 --> 00:15:10.576 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我来当你的对手！</c.simplifiedchinese>

277
00:15:10.659 --> 00:15:12.494 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他被困住了…</c.simplifiedchinese>

278
00:15:15.080 --> 00:15:16.957 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你们在做什么 白痴？</c.simplifiedchinese>

279
00:15:17.041 --> 00:15:18.667 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>一个一个上！</c.simplifiedchinese>

280
00:15:24.715 --> 00:15:25.883 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>原来如此</c.simplifiedchinese>

281
00:15:25.966 --> 00:15:27.843 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他假装被追</c.simplifiedchinese>

282
00:15:27.927 --> 00:15:32.097 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>其实是把人引进狭窄的地方
展开一对一的对决</c.simplifiedchinese>

283
00:15:32.181 --> 00:15:33.557 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他发现了</c.simplifiedchinese>

284
00:15:33.641 --> 00:15:35.809 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但这就是你的葬身之地</c.simplifiedchinese>

285
00:15:35.893 --> 00:15:37.770 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他没有退路了</c.simplifiedchinese>

286
00:15:37.853 --> 00:15:39.521 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>慢慢逼近他</c.simplifiedchinese>

287
00:15:40.230 --> 00:15:42.149 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不用手下留情</c.simplifiedchinese>

288
00:15:42.232 --> 00:15:46.820 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>就算杀一、两个人
只要把尸体埋了就不会有人知道</c.simplifiedchinese>

289
00:15:49.573 --> 00:15:50.741 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>愣着干什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

290
00:15:50.824 --> 00:15:52.701 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>快上！</c.simplifiedchinese>

291
00:16:01.210 --> 00:16:02.795 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那个十字刀疤</c.simplifiedchinese>

292
00:16:02.878 --> 00:16:05.214 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>听说不好惹…</c.simplifiedchinese>

293
00:16:05.297 --> 00:16:07.716 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>打手斩左也在！</c.simplifiedchinese>

294
00:16:07.800 --> 00:16:08.801 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>快跑！</c.simplifiedchinese>

295
00:16:08.884 --> 00:16:10.386 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不然就死定了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

296
00:16:10.469 --> 00:16:12.513 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>喂！你们这些胆小鬼！</c.simplifiedchinese>

297
00:16:16.517 --> 00:16:19.937 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们的出场就结束了</c.simplifiedchinese>

298
00:16:20.020 --> 00:16:21.855 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是呀</c.simplifiedchinese>

299
00:16:21.939 --> 00:16:26.276 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过你怎么知道在下在这里？</c.simplifiedchinese>

300
00:16:26.360 --> 00:16:28.070 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下明明没有告诉任何人</c.simplifiedchinese>

301
00:16:28.654 --> 00:16:29.947 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>当然知道了</c.simplifiedchinese>

302
00:16:30.030 --> 00:16:31.949 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>就算这是“弥彦的战斗”</c.simplifiedchinese>

303
00:16:32.032 --> 00:16:36.245 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他要是输了
小姑娘燕和红牛酒馆都会陷入危险</c.simplifiedchinese>

304
00:16:36.328 --> 00:16:39.248 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>以你的性格不会袖手旁观</c.simplifiedchinese>

305
00:16:39.331 --> 00:16:45.879 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你为人那么傻那么善良
怎么会把那句狮子的谚语付诸实践？</c.simplifiedchinese>

306
00:16:46.630 --> 00:16:49.508 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>真不知这是夸还是损…</c.simplifiedchinese>

307
00:16:49.591 --> 00:16:52.720 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>无论如何 接下来就是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

308
00:16:52.803 --> 00:16:56.390 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是啊 真正的一对一对决</c.simplifiedchinese>

309
00:16:56.890 --> 00:16:58.142 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>没想到有一天</c.simplifiedchinese>

310
00:16:58.225 --> 00:17:05.149 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我长冈干雄流的真传剑术
竟然用来对付一个小屁孩！</c.simplifiedchinese>

311
00:17:08.527 --> 00:17:09.778 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我能看穿…</c.simplifiedchinese>

312
00:17:11.822 --> 00:17:12.698 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>头！</c.simplifiedchinese>

313
00:17:15.284 --> 00:17:18.370 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>认真起来 我也能看穿他的招式</c.simplifiedchinese>

314
00:17:18.996 --> 00:17:22.374 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>每天的训练得到了回报</c.simplifiedchinese>

315
00:17:23.250 --> 00:17:26.837 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>虽然不想承认 但还是要感谢薰</c.simplifiedchinese>

316
00:17:27.880 --> 00:17:30.007 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>臭小子！</c.simplifiedchinese>

317
00:17:31.675 --> 00:17:32.843 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这么晚了</c.simplifiedchinese>

318
00:17:33.427 --> 00:17:35.554 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>女孩子一个人在外面很危险的哦</c.simplifiedchinese>

319
00:17:37.639 --> 00:17:39.099 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我是神谷薰</c.simplifiedchinese>

320
00:17:39.183 --> 00:17:41.143 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>弥彦的剑术师父</c.simplifiedchinese>

321
00:17:42.061 --> 00:17:43.520 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你是来阻止那个男人的吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

322
00:17:46.648 --> 00:17:47.524 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>很遗憾</c.simplifiedchinese>

323
00:17:47.608 --> 00:17:50.986 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>小燕你是没法阻止他的</c.simplifiedchinese>

324
00:17:51.945 --> 00:17:53.614 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>都交给弥彦吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

325
00:17:54.406 --> 00:17:57.076 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但我们来做个约定吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

326
00:17:57.159 --> 00:17:58.327 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>约定？</c.simplifiedchinese>

327
00:17:58.911 --> 00:18:02.498 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果弥彦赢了 小燕你要坚强起来</c.simplifiedchinese>

328
00:18:03.832 --> 00:18:06.585 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不要被无聊的陈旧观念束缚住</c.simplifiedchinese>

329
00:18:06.668 --> 00:18:09.963 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>下次一开始就坚决对他说不</c.simplifiedchinese>

330
00:18:11.006 --> 00:18:14.885 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>时代变了 现在是四民平等的时代</c.simplifiedchinese>

331
00:18:14.968 --> 00:18:18.430 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但如果人们的观念没变就没意义了</c.simplifiedchinese>

332
00:18:19.431 --> 00:18:21.100 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>臭小子！</c.simplifiedchinese>

333
00:18:21.183 --> 00:18:23.102 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>结束了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

334
00:18:23.185 --> 00:18:24.561 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>长冈干雄流…</c.simplifiedchinese>

335
00:18:24.645 --> 00:18:25.813 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>必杀</c.simplifiedchinese>

336
00:18:25.896 --> 00:18:28.065 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>浮足落！</c.simplifiedchinese>

337
00:18:31.902 --> 00:18:33.904 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>糟了 我的右脚…</c.simplifiedchinese>

338
00:18:33.987 --> 00:18:35.114 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>要赢啊！</c.simplifiedchinese>

339
00:18:35.197 --> 00:18:37.574 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>一定要赢啊 弥彦！</c.simplifiedchinese>

340
00:18:38.867 --> 00:18:39.993 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

341
00:18:40.077 --> 00:18:44.873 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>守护之人的命运就悬在我的剑上！</c.simplifiedchinese>

342
00:18:52.089 --> 00:18:54.550 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我…要赢！</c.simplifiedchinese>

343
00:19:00.514 --> 00:19:01.765 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>所以说</c.simplifiedchinese>

344
00:19:02.266 --> 00:19:05.394 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你怎么在这 薰？</c.simplifiedchinese>

345
00:19:08.188 --> 00:19:09.690 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>还有…</c.simplifiedchinese>

346
00:19:09.773 --> 00:19:12.067 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>屋顶上那两个！</c.simplifiedchinese>

347
00:19:16.488 --> 00:19:18.115 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>春天哪来的蝉鸣啊！</c.simplifiedchinese>

348
00:19:18.866 --> 00:19:19.908 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>真是的</c.simplifiedchinese>

349
00:19:19.992 --> 00:19:22.202 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>一群爱操心的家伙</c.simplifiedchinese>

350
00:19:23.829 --> 00:19:25.998 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我送小燕回家</c.simplifiedchinese>

351
00:19:26.081 --> 00:19:27.332 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你们先回去吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

352
00:19:27.416 --> 00:19:30.085 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>好 路上小心</c.simplifiedchinese>

353
00:19:30.169 --> 00:19:32.629 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>真的谢谢你 弥彦</c.simplifiedchinese>

354
00:19:32.713 --> 00:19:34.381 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>道谢就不必了</c.simplifiedchinese>

355
00:19:34.464 --> 00:19:39.344 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我只是不喜欢看见别人
战战兢兢 畏畏缩缩的样子</c.simplifiedchinese>

356
00:19:39.428 --> 00:19:41.346 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>嗯 所以</c.simplifiedchinese>

357
00:19:41.930 --> 00:19:45.142 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我以后不会再战战兢兢的了</c.simplifiedchinese>

358
00:19:47.686 --> 00:19:49.479 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那明天</c.simplifiedchinese>

359
00:19:49.563 --> 00:19:50.564 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们在红牛见</c.simplifiedchinese>

360
00:19:52.024 --> 00:19:54.193 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这样又一件事圆满解决…</c.simplifiedchinese>

361
00:19:54.276 --> 00:19:56.528 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不 还没有</c.simplifiedchinese>

362
00:19:57.112 --> 00:20:00.991 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们还不知道这小家伙
去打工的理由呢</c.simplifiedchinese>

363
00:20:01.074 --> 00:20:05.204 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你要是还坚决不说 那我就…</c.simplifiedchinese>

364
00:20:05.287 --> 00:20:06.455 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>好吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

365
00:20:06.538 --> 00:20:08.290 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那我说…</c.simplifiedchinese>

366
00:20:08.790 --> 00:20:11.084 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我想买逆刃刀</c.simplifiedchinese>

367
00:20:11.168 --> 00:20:14.838 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>当我和剑心一样厉害时
我也要有一把逆刃刀</c.simplifiedchinese>

368
00:20:14.922 --> 00:20:17.674 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>现在我是在提前攒钱</c.simplifiedchinese>

369
00:20:21.345 --> 00:20:22.763 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>弥彦用逆刃刀！</c.simplifiedchinese>

370
00:20:22.846 --> 00:20:25.349 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>笑什么啊 你个鸡冠头！</c.simplifiedchinese>

371
00:20:25.432 --> 00:20:27.392 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>所以我才瞒着你们</c.simplifiedchinese>

372
00:20:27.476 --> 00:20:30.103 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>听好了 千万别告诉薰</c.simplifiedchinese>

373
00:20:30.187 --> 00:20:32.731 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>她也肯定会笑我</c.simplifiedchinese>

374
00:20:32.814 --> 00:20:35.943 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>&lrm;-但我已经听到了
&lrm;-好了 不准说出去！</c.simplifiedchinese>

375
00:20:37.861 --> 00:20:39.738 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心</c.simplifiedchinese>

376
00:20:39.821 --> 00:20:40.822 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>弥彦</c.simplifiedchinese>

377
00:20:41.949 --> 00:20:44.326 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>逆刃刀很贵的</c.simplifiedchinese>

378
00:20:44.409 --> 00:20:45.577 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>很贵吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

379
00:20:45.661 --> 00:20:47.204 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>很贵…</c.simplifiedchinese>

380
00:20:47.287 --> 00:20:48.497 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>很贵啊…</c.simplifiedchinese>

381
00:22:36.396 --> 00:22:37.522 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>好</c.simplifiedchinese>

382
00:22:45.655 --> 00:22:49.367 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>下一集 《那个男人 雷十太》</c.simplifiedchinese>

